{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>And one goat for a sin-offering to YHWH.</b> Like 'upon which the lot fell for YHWH, and offer it as a sin-offering.' Know that חטאת with a lamed in the sacred language — the sin-offering cleaves only to the sinner. Do you not see 'and I have sinned against my father' — and behold, this is the opposite of the derash; rather it has a sod."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:19:45.167218368Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}